  "readme": "# React\n\nReact is a world-class JavaScript library for building modern, resilient, declarative user interfaces on the web and native mobile platforms.\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n```bash\nnpm install react react-dom\n```\n\n## Usage and Examples\n\n```javascript\nimport React from 'react';\nfunction App() { return <h1>Hello World</h1>; }\n```\n\n## Visual Overview\n\n![React Architecture](https://react.dev/images/architecture.png)\n\n## License\n\nReact is licensed under the permissive MIT license. See LICENSE file for details.\n",
